            "title": "Naming",
            "id": 127527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podobnie jak w przypadku nazywania zmiennych i funkcji, podczas definiowania klas stosuje się pewne powszechne praktyki.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" teacher = \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"150\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>Person</code>, a następnie <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Class name",
            "id": 127528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W nazwach klas zwykle pierwsza litera jest wielka, a pozostałe są małe, tak jak w przypadku <code>Person</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Descriptive",
            "id": 127529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podobnie jak w przypadku zmiennych, staramy się nadawać klasom opisowe nazwy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", title: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>class</code>, a następnie <code>Book</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Consistent",
            "id": 127530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tak jak w przypadku nazywania zmiennych i funkcji, powinniśmy nazywać rzeczy konsekwentnie i zwracać uwagę na wielkość liter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"init\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"self\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" teacher = \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", age: \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"273\" /><option startIndex=\"273\" endIndex=\"274\" /><option startIndex=\"274\" endIndex=\"275\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>sayBye</code>, następnie <code>(</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
